        "en": "What renderer.render() does each frame"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "Three.js 自己不画像素：它决定发哪些绘制命令、按什么顺序、带什么状态，再经 WebGL 或 WebGPU、浏览器和驱动交给 GPU。",
        "en": "Three.js draws no pixels itself: it decides which draw calls to issue, in what order and with what state, and hands them through WebGL or WebGPU, the browser and the driver to the GPU."
