      "title": {
        "zh": "场景图与世界矩阵",
        "en": "The scene graph and world matrices"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "每个 Object3D 存相对父节点的位置、四元数和缩放；世界矩阵是从根一路乘下来的。默认每一帧每个节点都重算一遍，render 之前读到的是上一帧的值。",
        "en": "Each Object3D stores position, quaternion and scale relative to its parent; its world matrix is the product down from the root. By default every node is recomputed every frame, and reading it before render gives last frame's value."
      },
      "source": "../computing/software/how-threejs-draws-a-scene/#ch2",
