      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "一个点经视图矩阵、投影矩阵、除以 w 和视口变换变成像素和深度。深度不均匀：近平面附近用掉了大部分格子，远处的两个面会抢同一个深度，这就是 z-fighting。",
        "en": "A point becomes a pixel and a depth through the view matrix, the projection matrix, the divide by w and the viewport. Depth is not uniform: most values go near the near plane, so far-away surfaces share a depth and z-fight."
      },
