        "en": "How a material becomes a shader program"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "材质是参数；three.js 把着色器片段和 #define 拼成程序，用一长串参数当钥匙缓存。灯的数量在每个钥匙里，加一盏灯所有材质都要重新编译。",
        "en": "A material is parameters; three.js assembles a program from shader chunks and #defines and caches it under a long key. Light counts are in every key, so adding a light recompiles every material."
